commit 639695da4e2898c8b4d4319b6b0bb6c9b982eb20
ndt: keep one drop-check log per bring-up and flag paths on an external plane

The drop check's full answer used to go to a single heartbeat_drop_check.log, which the
next bring-up overwrote; each bring-up now writes its own file and names it on the one
line it prints. ndt status now flags a nonzero destination path count on an external
control plane, where the proxy reports none, as a --check problem.


